## Bundled software

### RSSHub — AGPL-3.0
https://github.com/DIYgod/RSSHub

Bundled to provide feeds for Telegram, Bilibili, Zhihu, GitHub, X and other
services. Its full license text ships with the application; the corresponding
source is available at the URL above.

### Miniflux — Apache-2.0
https://github.com/miniflux/v2

Its feed-reading packages (parsing, charset handling, HTML sanitising, site
rules) are copied into native/reader/third_party/miniflux with import paths
rewritten; the upstream commit is recorded in UPSTREAM there, and its LICENSE
ships alongside.

### go-trafilatura — Apache-2.0
https://github.com/markusmobius/go-trafilatura

Article body extraction in the reader core. Its dependencies (go-readability,
go-domdistiller, go-htmldate, go-py3langid and others) are MIT, BSD or
Apache-2.0 licensed; see native/reader/go.mod.

## Feed catalogue

The built-in feed catalogue is this project's own compilation. Every entry was
independently verified for reachability and freshness and categorised under this
project's own taxonomy and trust weights. Feed URLs are factual data and carry no
copyright.

## Free services used at runtime

- Google News search RSS — no key required
- Bing News search RSS — no key required
- Telegram public channel previews (t.me/s/) — no key required
- GDELT DOC 2.0 API — no key required (optional, rate-limited)
